                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jewe Yohana numvise ivyo, ndavyibonera. Mmaze kuvyumva no kubibona, nikubita hasi imbere y’ibirenge vy’umumarayika anyeretse ivyo, ngira ndamusenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambarira, at’ Oya sigaho; nd’umugurano mugenzawe, kandi ndi mugenzi wa bene So, abavugishwa n’Imana, n’uw’ abitondera amajambo y’iki gitabo. Imana ba ari yo usenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
